{
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "fps": 30,
  "duration": 110.53333333333333,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "01-hook",
      "text": "只剩三张兵力票，还能赢吗？这场据点争夺，最后真的险胜了。",
      "english": [
        "Only three tickets left.",
        "Could we still win?",
        "This conquest match",
        "ended in a very close victory."
      ],
      "start": 0,
      "end": 7.166666666666667,
      "duration": 7.166666666666667,
      "voice_duration": 6.816,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 215,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\01-hook.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-map",
      "text": "这是虫潮围城的战地模式。旧镇、通信站、补给仓库，抢的就是这三个点。",
      "english": [
        "This is the Battlefield mode in Swarm Siege.",
        "Old Town, Comms Station and Supply Depot:",
        "these are the three objectives."
      ],
      "start": 7.166666666666667,
      "end": 15.3,
      "duration": 8.133333333333333,
      "voice_duration": 7.776,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 244,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\02-map.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-tickets",
      "text": "控制两个点，就会持续扣掉对面的兵力票。光顾着追人，旗子被偷，照样会输。喜欢这个玩法，顺手点个赞。",
      "english": [
        "Control two objectives",
        "and the enemy keeps losing tickets.",
        "Chase enemies while",
        "your flags get taken,",
        "and you can still lose.",
        "If you like this mode,",
        "leave a like."
      ],
      "start": 15.3,
      "end": 26.53333333333333,
      "duration": 11.233333333333333,
      "voice_duration": 10.872,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 337,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\03-tickets.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-kit",
      "text": "这次没有买兵和升级。五种兵种用固定装备，开局我选工程兵，先开坦克推进。",
      "english": [
        "There is no troop purchasing or leveling up here.",
        "Five classes have fixed loadouts.",
        "I choose Engineer at the start",
        "and push forward in a tank."
      ],
      "start": 26.53333333333333,
      "end": 35.233333333333334,
      "duration": 8.7,
      "voice_duration": 8.352,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 261,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\04-kit.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-tank",
      "text": "这段是另开一局补拍的载具战。坦克沿着道路推进，挨打会掉装甲，步兵也在往旗点靠。",
      "english": [
        "This vehicle footage is from a separate match.",
        "The tank advances along the road.",
        "Its armor drops when it takes hits.",
        "Infantry are moving toward the objectives too."
      ],
      "start": 35.233333333333334,
      "end": 44.13333333333333,
      "duration": 8.9,
      "voice_duration": 8.544,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 267,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\05-tank.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-spawn",
      "text": "回到主战局，第一波我就倒了。但不用一直从老家跑：选已经占住的仓库，换成医疗兵，再部署到前线。",
      "english": [
        "Back in the main match,",
        "I went down in the first push.",
        "Select our captured depot instead of running from HQ,",
        "switch to Medic,",
        "and redeploy near the front."
      ],
      "start": 44.13333333333333,
      "end": 54.1,
      "duration": 9.966666666666667,
      "voice_duration": 9.624,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 299,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\06-spawn.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-heal",
      "text": "残血的时候按支援，血量就能补回来。活着留在圈里，比冲出去再送一次更有用。",
      "english": [
        "Use support when hurt",
        "to recover health.",
        "Staying alive inside the objective",
        "helps more than rushing out and dying again."
      ],
      "start": 54.1,
      "end": 62.36666666666667,
      "duration": 8.266666666666667,
      "voice_duration": 7.92,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 248,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\07-heal.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-fight",
      "text": "中间的通信站反复易手。我贴着掩体交火，再扔手雷压住路口。对面也会开车和反扑，真不能一直硬冲。",
      "english": [
        "The central Comms Station changes hands repeatedly.",
        "I fight from cover",
        "and throw a grenade toward the junction.",
        "The enemy uses vehicles and counterattacks too.",
        "I cannot just keep charging straight in."
      ],
      "start": 62.36666666666667,
      "end": 73.53333333333333,
      "duration": 11.166666666666666,
      "voice_duration": 10.824,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 335,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\08-fight.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-finish",
      "text": "到最后，两边兵力都见底了。我们守住通信站和仓库，对面票数归零，我方剩三票。",
      "english": [
        "By the end,",
        "both teams were almost out of tickets.",
        "We held Comms Station and Supply Depot.",
        "The enemy reached zero;",
        "we had three left."
      ],
      "start": 73.53333333333333,
      "end": 82.8,
      "duration": 9.266666666666667,
      "voice_duration": 8.904,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 278,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\09-finish.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "10-result",
      "text": "结算挺有意思：我方击杀九十四，对面一百零五。杀得更多的一边，反而输了。抢点和保住自己，都得算进去。",
      "english": [
        "The result is interesting: our team scored 94 kills,",
        "and theirs scored 105.",
        "The team with more kills",
        "still lost.",
        "Objectives and staying alive",
        "both matter."
      ],
      "start": 82.8,
      "end": 94.26666666666667,
      "duration": 11.466666666666667,
      "voice_duration": 11.112,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 344,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\10-result.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-close",
      "text": "这一局靠占点赢下来了，正面硬冲还是很容易倒。下次我想试试兵种配合和侧翼夺点。虫潮围城现在可以在百宝箱试玩，想玩什么也可以填愿望单。",
      "english": [
        "We won this match through objective control,",
        "but direct charges were still deadly.",
        "Next time I want to try class teamwork and flanking.",
        "You can now play 虫潮围城, Swarm Siege, on the Treasure Box website.",
        "You can also submit a game idea to the wishlist."
      ],
      "start": 94.26666666666667,
      "end": 110.53333333333333,
      "duration": 16.266666666666666,
      "voice_duration": 13.92,
      "voice_offset": 0.12,
      "frames": 488,
      "wav": "audio\\shared-zh\\11-close.wav"
    }
  ],
